{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 47","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are the roots of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/1/98172d1b54b563033d26dc22c407dad4d4802be5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302784340ca1a58f526dc9f9457fe9d64c474ba9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{r^{2}}+\\frac{1}{s^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"60\" height=\"37\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/5/ef5d817038b2f51136767743740511bf6d71574f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ b^{2}-4ac\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{b^{2}-4ac}{2a}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{b^{2}-4ac}{c^{2}}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{b^{2}-2ac}{c^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"504\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a4599cf9c5dfa99b4194c4a23fab69df841f6dd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/8/d88ae6e217536e5ca43ade76503a86de45295fc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{r^2}+\\frac{1}{s^2} = \\frac{r^2+s^2}{r^2s^2} = \\frac{(r+s)^2-2(rs)}{(rs)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"299\" height=\"45\" />. \n</p><p>By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s\">Vieta's</a>, this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/7/877f50855a86cacbcddb1cc1364620d74533623b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(-\\frac{b}{a})^2-2(\\frac{c}{a})}{(\\frac{c}{a})^2} = \\frac{\\frac{b^2}{a^2}-\\frac{2c}{a}}{\\frac{c^2}{a^2}} = \\frac{b^2-2ac}{c^2} \\implies \\boxed{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"377\" height=\"53\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> can be found in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> by using the quadratic formula; the roots are\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/b/bcb2a47ec2229e2d6ee27a928e7f4d9c3c6cc06e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}\\]\" width=\"123\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>By Vieta's Formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89d30ff690f4b7210f16e8c7691e6e04ce917a11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r+s=-\\frac{b}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"90\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/e/0ee2b9209841b8ecd9dcccefbdccbb8560acbe85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$rs=\\frac{c}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"53\" height=\"33\" />. Now let's algebraically manipulate what we want to find:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/c/b0c3e496d71654f1cfb42d83c9b7bf95bc783d9b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{r^2}+\\frac{1}{s^2}=\\frac{r^2+s^2}{r^2s^2}=\\frac{(r+s)^2-2rs}{(rs)^2}\\]\" width=\"279\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in the values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/e/29eefdbecef075e27a91b7ef23643c5283b4ad2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r+s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/8/c889d12451d321614e219737373586e45b71a141.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$rs$\" width=\"16\" height=\"8\" /> gives\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/5/b05e1b7e2647ef9babb22f26d12d01c2fb29378b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{r^2}+\\frac{1}{s^2}=\\frac{(-b/a)^2-2(c/a)}{(c/a)^2}=\\boxed{\\frac{b^2-2ca}{c^2}\\textbf{(D)}}\\]\" width=\"356\" height=\"50\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre>here <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are the roots of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/1/98172d1b54b563033d26dc22c407dad4d4802be5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" />,\n</pre>\n<pre>now we can convert this equation with roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/2/e2221c84f16a3f75ae07e5023384cc40d9c05357.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^2$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/2/752ccf51ef0be42644a0099346e876310df962f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" />.\n</pre>\n<pre>let, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/f/8ef862bdd16c2d5356e11735b8c766c402f5e10c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> then above equation becomes\n</pre>\n<pre><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/3/3c31a91d833d10648ab0ffd60422aa4cf4605f35.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ay+c=-b\\sqrt y\\]\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" /> square on both sides we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/3/8e3ceb3c6ab1d6603c8971dffa68657150d73155.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2y^2 +(2ac-b^2)y +c^2 =0\\]\" width=\"214\" height=\"19\" />\n</pre>\n<pre>Again we can change this equation with roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/5/c95e21179500b878311d0f020631d511dac0ddac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{r^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"18\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/a/5fabfb1e6585f80621dde352d14b1088d6fc2726.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{s^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"18\" height=\"37\" /> .\n</pre>\n<p>let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23fcb3122def4289b574d027d43498a73a2601bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=\\frac{1}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"45\" height=\"40\" /> then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/4/5142946d020e8a7e6d68a327e033054d6e81c757.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2\\frac{1}{z^2}+\\frac{2ac-b^2}{z}+c^2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"198\" height=\"39\" /> then\n</p>\n<pre>       <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/5/d4564764a1570854c116ffea2f6d1fb54190094f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[c^2z^2+z(2ac-b^2)+a^2=0\\]\" width=\"213\" height=\"19\" />\n</pre>\n<p>then the sum of roots of the above equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/f/d4fc5fa70cd702f9db0fe737f9c16bca2b52859f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{r^2}+\\frac{1}{s^2}=\\frac{b^2-2ac}{c^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"153\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<pre>hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/d/ccd95ffc5f1413e967c742cf5c094c04819943e0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{r^2}+\\frac{1}{s^2}=\\boxed{\\frac{b^2-2ca}{c^2}\\textbf{(D)}}\\]\" width=\"194\" height=\"50\" />\n</pre>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME\" title=\"1951 AHSME\">1951 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1951 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1951\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 46\">Problem 46</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 48\">Problem 48</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 41\">41</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 42\">42</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 43\">43</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 44\">44</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 45\">45</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 46\">46</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">47</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 48\">48</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 49\">49</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 50\">50</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017041620\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 327/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3464/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 236/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6768/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.459      1 -total\n 64.70%    9.355      1 Template:AHSME_50p_box\n 33.79%    4.885      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11116:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 2026101704162